+---
+id: task-002-add-rental-availability-query
+type: task
+title: "Add rental availability query"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+Implemented `RentalService.availability(query)` with optional board or sail filtering. It validates
+the same whole-day UTC period rules as bookings, excludes every item with an overlapping booking,
+and returns ids in ascending order.
+
+Added coverage for filtering, sorting, overlapping and adjacent bookings, plus invalid queries.
+Verified with `npm test`.
